From f21f92e148c86d594018ef1b2ddea1db6e74df5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrei Lepikhov <lepihov@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:08:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH v1 2/2] Add docs and tests for EXPLAIN's "Outer Rows
 Unmatched"

Document the new line in perform.sgml and cover it with regression
tests: all three join methods for INNER, LEFT, SEMI, ANTI and FULL
joins, NULL keys, residual join quals, parameterized nested loops,
rescans including an empty hash table, multi-batch and parallel hash
joins, and the JSON format.

Existing tests whose plans now show the line get updated expected
output.  explain_parallel_append() in partition_prune.sql masks the
value, which depends on the number of workers.
